# Bulk resolution-feed data lives in R2, not git (AGENTS.md): the manifests
# `*.r2.json` beside this file are the tracked record. These directories are
# rebuilt by `ladderrv candles|vol|clob|tape|live` and run to tens of MB —
# ignored so that a stray `git add -A` from a concurrent agent cannot sweep
# them into a commit.
candles/
vol/
out/
tape/
clob*/
# `events/` (raw Gamma events written by `ladderrv discover`) was NOT listed until 2026-07-30,
# so 1.1 MB of bulk JSON sat outside the ignore list that exists precisely to stop a
# concurrent agent's blanket add from sweeping bulk data in. `legs.csv` is derived and
# regenerated every run. Both are frozen to R2 in `live-<date>.tar.gz`.
# NOTE: `events_live/` is deliberately NOT ignored — it is small, it is the per-board fine
# print we reason about, and it is already tracked.
events/
legs.csv
